    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d458">

                <pb facs="0570" n="462" sameAs="frus:frus1893/pg462"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Señor
                            Romero.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-09-25"><hi rendition="#italic">September 25,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 6th instant relative to the alleged violation of Mexican
                    territory through the arrest at Nogales, Mexico, by John Roberts, deputy sheriff
                    at Nogales, Ariz., of Jesus Garcia, a citizen of Mexico.</p>
                <p>The governor of Arizona Territory has been asked to cause a searching
                    investigation and to report the facts.</p>
                <p>Accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
